eople from believing when guidance came to them except that they said, \"Has Allāh sent a human messenger?\"","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":94,"sd":null},{"k":"17:95","t":"Say, \"If there were upon the earth angels walking securely, We would have sent down to them from the heaven an angel [as a] messenger.\"","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":95,"sd":null},{"k":"17:96","t":"Say, \"Sufficient is Allāh as Witness between me and you. Indeed He is ever, concerning His servants, Aware and Seeing.\"","j":15,"h":29,"s":17,"a":96,"sd":null}],"juz":15,"hizb":29,"surahs":[17],"sajdah":false}